         ${misc:Depends}
Suggests: stom-pi
Description: JSFX plugin bridge for Rustyfoot
 Provides the JSFX-to-LV2 bridge tooling for the Rustyfoot pedalboard
 platform. Allows JSFX effects (REAPER's scripted audio plugins) to be
 loaded by mod-host as native LV2 plugins with auto-generated control
 ports and modgui.
 .
 Includes a shared LV2 wrapper binary (jsfx-wrapper.so) that is symlinked
 into generated LV2 bundles, and a scanner tool (stom-pi-jsfx-scan) that
 introspects JSFX files and generates wrapper metadata.
